          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konye ainakinet mam eputos kaibucaret. Naarai arai apotu luipu kotwaka kanuka aibucaret naka ediopet, aitelekarit noi epoloor asianut naka Edeke ka ainakinet naejai toma asianut naka etuŋanan ediopet Yesu Kristo, kanuka luipu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.5.15"
            ]
