        },
        {
          "text": "Ido ainakinet mam eputos kanaayau loadiakaa. Naarai etube loabu kobu kanuka ediopetuŋanan abu koyau atubokinio, konye ainakinet naabu kobu kanuka aibucanareta nuipu ayau aitojokio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
